# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — OHOS 代码页完整性 (XPM) 封死一切自改代码路径 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-05
# Software: boxfort 0.1.2
# Gate: 原生测试 / conan-verify G2 / W3
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
# Related: E045 (RWX 分配被 W^X 拒绝) — 本条覆盖 E045 未涉及的三类文本页写入路径

id:                     E1792
severity:               3
category:               platform, kernel, security, memory
trigger_tool: clang|any JIT/trampoline/sandbox library
phase: runtime
error_signature: bxf_run.*-71|EPROTO.*wait_stop|WIFSTOPPED|Protocol error.*sandbox|
  mprotect.*EINVAL.*text|execve.*worker.*exit

match_keywords: mprotect, PROT_EXEC, SIGSEGV, /proc/self/mem, EPERM, MAP_FIXED,
  code page, trampoline, sandbox, patch_main, WIFSTOPPED, EPROTO

root_cause: OHOS 内核对用户态可执行映射实施代码页完整性保护 (XPM), 实测 (HUAWEI MateBook Pro,
  OHOS 6.1.1, clang 15.0.4) 四条自改代码路径全部被封死:
  1) mprotect(text_page, PROT_READ|PROT_WRITE|PROT_EXEC) -> EINVAL(22) 直接拒绝;
  2) mprotect(text_page, PROT_READ|PROT_WRITE) -> 系统调用层放行但进程随即被内核 SIGSEGV 击杀;
  3) 通过 /proc/self/mem pwrite 代码页 -> EPERM(13);
  4) mmap(MAP_PRIVATE|MAP_ANONYMOUS|MAP_FIXED) 覆盖已执行代码页 -> 进程被内核 SIGSEGV 击杀。
  因此任何"先获得可写代码页再写跳板"的策略均不可行, 且无 /proc/self/mem 逃逸通道。
affected_scope: 自修改代码类机制: boxfort patch_main 重执行跳板、运行时代码 patch、文本页内联
  hook、依赖改写 main 的沙箱握手; 纯 JIT/闭包 (libffi) 见 E045, 本条补足"文件映射代码页"边界

rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: ohos-conditional-direct-run
verification_cmd: "对自身函数所在页: mprotect(RWX) 期望 EINVAL; mprotect(RW) 期望进程被杀;
  /proc/self/mem pwrite 期望 EPERM; boxfort 适配后 meson test 4/4 PASS (native) +
  conan create + test_package 12 断言 PASS (boxfort/0.1.2, feat/boxfort-0.1.2)"
rec_auto_fix:               false
rec_impl:               manual
last_updated:               2026-10-17
authors:               unknown
doc_file:               doc/E1792.md
rec_description:        ohos-conditional-direct-run
